candela is a fork of keel (https://github.com/horacehoff/keel) by Horace Hoff.

Original work licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Renamed and extended for the Lumen UI framework.

The original keel copyright and Apache-2.0 license terms are retained in
full in the LICENSE file. All original authorship by Horace Hoff is
preserved. Modifications include a host-embeddable Engine/Program API,
variadic host functions, array/map marshalling across the host boundary,
structured diagnostics, and the rename of the language and crate to
candela (source file extension: .cdl).

Every file in this distribution that derives from keel and has been
changed carries a notice to that effect at the top of the file. Five
keel-derived files cannot carry one, and this notice covers them instead:
Cargo.lock, docs/uv.lock and THIRD-PARTY-LICENSE are written by tooling
that discards comments, and the two images under docs/src/images/ were
renamed when the documentation moved. All five are changed from their keel
originals.

The keel commit history is preserved in this repository. Every change to
every keel-derived file is attributable to its author by commit.
